{
  "type": "mod",
  "id": 2808,
  "hub_id": null,
  "guid": "com.sorenbyte.sptmapprogression",
  "name": "Map Progression",
  "slug": "map-progression",
  "teaser": "Unlock maps based on your progress into the game. Start out with just Ground Zero. Fully configurable!",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/XupJXhb7jQHe4MUcaHuX2Y3xxsv3kBNBu9kLHxbT.png",
  "downloads": 2505,
  "favourites_count": 28,
  "description": "<h2>A mod that introduces map progression like in live Tarkov!</h2>\n<p>&lt;<strong>Maps Locked</strong>&gt; By default every map in the game is locked except for Ground Zero.</p>\n<p>&lt;<strong>Unlocking Maps</strong>&gt; In order to unlock a map you must complete its specific requirements.</p>\n<p>&lt;<strong>Map Requirements</strong>&gt; To see the requirements for a specific map you can simply hover over the lock icon.</p>\n<p>&lt;<strong>Scav Requirements</strong>&gt; If you want to run a map as a Scav you must survive on that map as a PMC enough times.</p>\n<p>&lt;<strong>Configuring</strong>&gt; If the mod is too difficult or unbalanced for your mod setup, you can change every requirement through the client config! (press F12 and find the mods name)</p>\n<hr />\n<blockquote>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<p><strong>1.</strong> Move the downloaded zip to your SPT folder</p>\n<p><strong>2.</strong> Unzip the .zip file with a tool like 7-zip</p>\n<p><strong>3.</strong> Launch your game and enjoy the mod!</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>Preview Image</h2>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SrGJ0eb.jpeg\" alt=\"Preview Image\" /></p>\n<h2>Preview Image With Tooltips</h2>\n<p>These are the things that pop up when you hover over the locked icon of a map.\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/S76UCyb.jpeg\" alt=\"Preview Image With Tooltips\" /></p>\n<h2>Future Plans</h2>\n<p>&lt;&gt; More requirements (Give me some suggestions!)</p>\n<p>&lt;&gt; Move map requirement config to a server mod.</p>\n<p>&lt;&gt; Add direct support for Fika (Not allowing map queue if a party member doesn’t have it unlocked)</p>\n<h2>Known Issues</h2>\n<p>&lt;&gt; Transiting with Fika installed will not fulfill the transit requirement.</p>\n<p>To any mod developers who view my mod and think they can help me with modding, or see a problem in my code, please let me know what I can do better! Thanks.</p>\n",
  "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2808/map-progression",
